      "bbox": {
        "l": 141.839556,
        "t": 551.894972,
        "r": 527.359056000001,
        "b": 509.0033489281768
      },
      "content": "When an emergency stop signal was  entered,  the  motor  did  not  decelerate,  rather accelerate, or the motor was kept excited even after acceleration/deceleration duration (10 seconds as set initially by a parameter)."
    },
    {
      "type": "list_item",
      "id": "txt_1646",
      "reading_order": 2153,
      "section": "1-24.  Alarm AL-37",
      "bbox": {
        "l": 99.29964599999998,
        "t": 483.85516400000006,
        "r": 269.683734,
        "b": 474.9834449281768
      },
      "content": "Cause and corrective action"
    },
    {
      "type": "list_item",
      "id": "txt_1647",
      "reading_order": 2154,
      "section": "1-24.  Alarm AL-37",
      "bbox": {
        "l": 106.37977799999999,
        "t": 466.87527200000005,
        "r": 378.1432199999999,
        "b": 441.0236609281768
      },
      "content": "Incorrect speed detector parameter setting Check the parameter setting and the speed detector."
    },
    {
      "type": "list_item",
      "id": "txt_1648",
      "reading_order": 2155,
      "section": "1-24.  Alarm AL-37",
      "bbox": {
        "l": 141.84,
        "t": 368.2403,
        "r": 489.19430999999867,
        "b": 353.5523
      },
      "content": "⇒ Set the parameter to the value that matches the speed detector used."
    },
    {
      "type": "list_item",
